{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 28,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked flee when no one pursues, but the righteous are as bold as a lion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A land in rebellion has many rulers, but a man of understanding and knowledge maintains order.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A destitute leader who oppresses the poor is like a driving rain that leaves no food.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Those who forsake the law praise the wicked, but those who keep the law resist them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evil men do not understand justice, but those who seek the LORD comprehend fully.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better a poor man who walks with integrity than a rich man whose ways are perverse.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A discerning son keeps the law, but a companion of gluttons disgraces his father.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who increases his wealth by interest and usury lays it up for one who is kind to the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoever turns his ear away from hearing the law, even his prayer is detestable.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who leads the upright along the path of evil will fall into his own pit, but the blameless will inherit what is good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A rich man is wise in his own eyes, but a poor man with discernment sees through him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the righteous triumph, there is great glory, but when the wicked rise, men hide themselves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who conceals his sins will not prosper, but whoever confesses and renounces them will find mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed is the man who is always reverent, but he who hardens his heart falls into trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Like a roaring lion or a charging bear is a wicked ruler over a helpless people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A leader who lacks judgment is also a great oppressor, but he who hates dishonest profit will prolong his days.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man burdened by bloodguilt will flee into the Pit; let no one support him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who walks with integrity will be kept safe, but whoever is perverse in his ways will suddenly fall.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The one who works his land will have plenty of food, but whoever chases fantasies will have his fill of poverty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A faithful man will abound with blessings, but one eager to be rich will not go unpunished.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To show partiality is not good, yet a man will do wrong for a piece of bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A stingy man hastens after wealth and does not know that poverty awaits him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who rebukes a man will later find more favor than one who flatters with his tongue.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who robs his father or mother, saying, “It is not wrong,” is a companion to the man who destroys.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A greedy man stirs up strife, but he who trusts in the LORD will prosper.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who trusts in himself is a fool, but one who walks in wisdom will be safe.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoever gives to the poor will not be in need, but he who hides his eyes will receive many curses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PRO.28.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the wicked come to power, people hide themselves; but when they perish, the righteous flourish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
